# Security checklist

- Never commit secrets; use env vars / secret stores only
- Validate Route Handler inputs; never trust client-only validation
- Sanitize / escape user-controlled content; prevent XSS
- NexHealth and GHL credentials stay server-side only
- Do not log PHI (patient names, DOB, full addresses, phone, email), tokens, or raw appointment payloads
- Prefer aggregated geo metrics over raw address dumps in the UI unless the doctor session is authenticated
